            </note>
            <note corresp="#d106-f4" n="4" xml:id="d106-f4-content">
                <p>The Embassy in London reported that Eliahu Elath, Israel’s Ambassador in the
                    United Kingdom, informed Shuckburgh on
                    May 13 that he and Eban had been recalled
                    to Tel Aviv for routine consultations.Shuckburgh, however, regarded their recalls to be “further
                    evidence Israeli anxiety regarding plans of U.S. and U.K.” (Telegram 5056 from
                    London, May 17; Department of State, Central Files, 684A.86/ 5–1755)</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
